    {
      "fragment_type": "behavioral_spec",
      "content": "Measurement Uncertainty per CISPR 16-4-2: Conducted Emission at mains port using AMN (150kHz-30MHz): U=3.2dB, Ucispr=3.4dB; Radiated Emission (30MHz-1000MHz): U=3.9dB, Ucispr=6.3dB; Radiated Emission (1GHz-6GHz): U=5.1dB, Ucispr=5.2dB. The measurement uncertainty represents an expanded uncertainty expressed at approximately the 95% confidence level using a coverage factor of k=2.",
