    {
      "fragment_type": "behavioral_spec",
      "content": "Radiated emission test operation: Pre-scan was performed with peak detector on the EUT. Quasi-peak measurements were performed at the frequencies at which maximum peak emission level were detected. During the tests, the EUT were tested at different working modes (Mode1, Mode2) to find the maximum emission results. For radiated emission: Level = Read Level + Antenna Factor + Cable Loss – Preamp Factor.",
